BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:New Year's Eve with the Soul Jazz Revival ft Reggie Headen
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261231T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261231T200000
UID:0290cad8b702c9a013f73d03eb49a97e@littlejumbobar.com
DESCRIPTION:Some nights just have it. The lights are low\, the glasses are
  cold\, and the band in the corner has been cooking since half past nine. 
 That’s New Year’s Eve at Little Jumbo.\n\nSoul Jazz Revival plays it t
 he way the great organ sessions did. Brian Felix’s organ swells and test
 ifies. Jacob Rodriguez’s sax takes its time. Andy Page’s guitar comps 
 clean and sharp. Quinn Sternberg and Joe Enright sit deep in the pocket an
 d stay there. Out front\, Reggie Headen brings a voice big enough to fill 
 the room and warm enough to fill the glass.\n\nThey’ll carry us right up
  to midnight\, pour the champagne\, and keep it swinging into 2027.\n\nDre
 ss sharp. Come early. The Creature is saving you a seat.\n\nTicketed entry
  9:00 p.m.  \nMusic 9:30 p.m. to 12:30 a.m.  \nBar open 4:00 p.m. to 1:00 
 a.m.  \n\nFr...
LOCATION:Little Jumbo: 241 Broadway St.\, Asheville\, NC 28801
URL:https://www.littlejumbobar.com/events/1811/new-year-s-eve-with-the-sou
 l-jazz-revival-ft-reggie-headen
X-SOURCE:Little Jumbo
END:VEVENT
